{
  "page": 14,
  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "14",
      "bbox": [
        556.0800170898438,
        27.916545867919922,
        563.0469360351562,
        37.219661712646484
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "that all ﬁlters converge to the same value. The only difference",
      "bbox": [
        48.96002197265625,
        54.6490478515625,
        300.34344482421875,
        67.939208984375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "w.r.t. the one-dimensional system is that LGVM ﬁlter detects",
      "bbox": [
        48.96003723144531,
        66.6490478515625,
        300.156494140625,
        79.939208984375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "the manoeuvre with a delay of one time instant (i.e., at time",
      "bbox": [
        48.96003723144531,
        78.6490478515625,
        300.1039733886719,
        91.939208984375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "t = 8); this is because the manoeuvre is made on the second",
      "bbox": [
        48.96003723144531,
        90.5291748046875,
        300.1811828613281,
        103.8193359375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "component of the state, which is not directly observable. It is",
      "bbox": [
        48.960018157958984,
        102.5291748046875,
        300.0355224609375,
        115.8193359375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "perhaps more interesting to remark the difference between KF",
      "bbox": [
        48.96002197265625,
        114.5291748046875,
        300.0192565917969,
        127.8193359375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "and LGVM in the lower plot of Figure 4. We can see there that",
      "bbox": [
        48.96003723144531,
        126.4093017578125,
        300.1298828125,
        139.699462890625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "at time t = 8 the upper mean goes to 30 which is the upper",
      "bbox": [
        48.96003723144531,
        138.4093017578125,
        300.1976013183594,
        151.699462890625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "bound for the second component of the state (remember that",
      "bbox": [
        48.95988464355469,
        150.2894287109375,
        300.1297607421875,
        163.57958984375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "we have assumed that this component is constrained to lie in",
      "bbox": [
        48.95988464355469,
        162.2894287109375,
        300.0615234375,
        175.57958984375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "[−30, 30]). This means that the upper mean is vacuous. This",
      "bbox": [
        48.95988464355469,
        174.2894287109375,
        300.1549377441406,
        194.34422302246094
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "behaviour is due to the lack of observability for the second",
      "bbox": [
        48.95988464355469,
        186.1695556640625,
        300.1806945800781,
        199.459716796875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "component of the state. In fact, the manoeuvre is so strong that",
      "bbox": [
        48.95988464355469,
        198.1695556640625,
        300.1294860839844,
        211.459716796875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "the second term in the last equation in (43) becomes dominant.",
      "bbox": [
        48.95988464355469,
        210.1695556640625,
        300.33056640625,
        223.459716796875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Since this term depends only on the measurement equation,",
      "bbox": [
        48.95989990234375,
        222.04925537109375,
        300.2106018066406,
        235.33941650390625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "the second component of the state is unobservable and, thus,",
      "bbox": [
        48.95989990234375,
        234.04925537109375,
        300.0903625488281,
        247.33941650390625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "free to vary during the optimisation. In practice, because of the",
      "bbox": [
        48.95989990234375,
        245.92938232421875,
        300.1032409667969,
        259.21954345703125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "manoeuvre, the information on the second component carried",
      "bbox": [
        48.95988464355469,
        257.92938232421875,
        300.18121337890625,
        271.21954345703125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "by the prior estimate ˆx0 is lost at time t = 8, and the LVGM",
      "bbox": [
        48.95988464355469,
        269.92938232421875,
        300.0974426269531,
        284.6597900390625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "ﬁlter has to estimate it again from the measurements. Thus, in",
      "bbox": [
        48.96018981933594,
        281.80950927734375,
        300.0605163574219,
        295.09967041015625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "one sense, the LGVM ﬁlter performs a re-initialisation after",
      "bbox": [
        48.96018981933594,
        293.80950927734375,
        300.0777587890625,
        307.09967041015625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "the manoeuvre.",
      "bbox": [
        48.96018981933594,
        305.80950927734375,
        111.8107681274414,
